[{"source" ":org/Math-Academy" "forms" [{:db/id 17592186166903 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-86e2d08a-1bef-5ead-ab02-f3370f825b7b" "question-38450a0f-4d09-5bde-a910-db2e5f9dab01"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186166902 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-eadcb6eb-28e0-561c-baf8-c3576858d2b7" "question-48e63c6e-e110-5f2f-9c73-cb4374b7c6c6" "question-56f780de-76f1-5a1a-81ae-abc4bc467c3f"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-eadcb6eb-28e0-561c-baf8-c3576858d2b7" :question/id #uuid "eadcb6eb-28e0-561c-baf8-c3576858d2b7" :question/math-academy-id "q-332585" :question/problem "$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t)=-3{x}_{1}(t)+2{x}_{2}(t)+5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)+7\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t) \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t)=4{x}_{1}(t)-{x}_{2}(t)+3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe systems of linear ODEs above can be written in matrix form as follows:\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" rowspan=\"2\">${x}^{′}(t)=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"40px\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"40px\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" rowspan=\"2\">$\\,\\,x(t)+\\,\\,$</td>\n<td height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-3}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" rowspan=\"2\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" rowspan=\"2\">$\\,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)+\\,\\,$</td>\n<td height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-4}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" rowspan=\"2\">$\\,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-5}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">{{field-6}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-7}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-8}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "First, let's rewrite our system, highlighting the coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t)=(-3)\\cdot {x}_{1}(t)+2\\cdot {x}_{2}(t)+5\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)+7\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(t) \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t)=4\\cdot {x}_{1}(t)+(-1)\\cdot {x}_{2}(t)+3\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)+(-2)\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in matrix form:\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2 \\\\ 4 & -1\\end{aligned}]x(t)+[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)+[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) \\\\ {x}_{2}(t)\\end{aligned}].$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1be54abc-d2f8-5e71-86b4-95e3ede8e8b9" "answer-field-5aed8437-ee45-5890-83bb-09c9f9e1bcc8" "answer-field-a5d80446-5433-569c-ad43-d2633b905967" "answer-field-3f6f012a-2c3a-5777-891a-7086389514fb" "answer-field-393e1770-3ee3-5e3e-950e-08a227d928cc" "answer-field-8e3bde12-1083-598d-9f01-6622ee8cbb56" "answer-field-1524671b-66ed-568b-a1ea-32c1c8729504" "answer-field-39227e03-733f-5344-954d-3c31f3502f19"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1be54abc-d2f8-5e71-86b4-95e3ede8e8b9" :answer-field/id #uuid "1be54abc-d2f8-5e71-86b4-95e3ede8e8b9" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-95276f1c-36f0-5f08-904e-b3c36535d237" :answer-field/choices ["answer-95276f1c-36f0-5f08-904e-b3c36535d237"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-95276f1c-36f0-5f08-904e-b3c36535d237" :answer/id #uuid "95276f1c-36f0-5f08-904e-b3c36535d237" :answer/type :answ