"center\" width=\"40px\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"40px\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" rowspan=\"2\">$\\,\\,x(t)+{e}^{3t}\\,\\,$</td>\n<td height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-3}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" rowspan=\"2\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-4}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">{{field-5}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-6}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>"] [17592186167173 :question/worked-solution "First, let's rewrite our system, highlighting the coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t)=3\\cdot {x}_{1}(t)+(-1)\\cdot {x}_{2}(t)+{e}^{3t}\\cdot 2 \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t)=(-2)\\cdot {x}_{1}(t)+0\\cdot {x}_{2}(t)+{e}^{3t}\\cdot (-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in matrix form:\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{aligned}]x(t)+{e}^{3t}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) \\\\ {x}_{2}(t)\\end{aligned}].$"] [17592186167173 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-c18deeca-337d-5220-a2ae-a86f49534a72" :answer/id #uuid "c18deeca-337d-5220-a2ae-a86f49534a72"] ["answer-c18deeca-337d-5220-a2ae-a86f49534a72" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c18deeca-337d-5220-a2ae-a86f49534a72" :answer/value "3"] [17592186164064 :answer-field/correct "answer-c18deeca-337d-5220-a2ae-a86f49534a72"] [17592186164064 :answer-field/choices "answer-c18deeca-337d-5220-a2ae-a86f49534a72"] ["answer-5415ccef-2daa-5ccc-b623-0d5b2ef82a22" :answer/id #uuid "5415ccef-2daa-5ccc-b623-0d5b2ef82a22"] ["answer-5415ccef-2daa-5ccc-b623-0d5b2ef82a22" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-5415ccef-2daa-5ccc-b623-0d5b2ef82a22" :answer/value "-1"] [17592186