stion/math-academy-id "q-332587"] ["question-48e63c6e-e110-5f2f-9c73-cb4374b7c6c6" :question/problem "$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t)={x}_{1}(t)-4{x}_{2}(t)+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t) \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t)=3{x}_{1}(t)+2{x}_{2}(t)+4\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe systems of linear ODEs above can be written in matrix form as follows:\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" rowspan=\"2\">${x}^{′}(t)=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"40px\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"40px\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" rowspan=\"2\">$\\,\\,x(t)+\\,\\,$</td>\n<td height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-3}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" rowspan=\"2\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" rowspan=\"2\">$\\,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)+\\,\\,$</td>\n<td height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-4}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" rowspan=\"2\">$\\,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-5}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">{{field-6}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-7}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-8}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>"] ["question-48e63c6e-e110-5f2f-9c73-cb4374b7c6c6" :question/worked-solution "First, let's rewrite our system, highlighting the coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t)=1\\cdot {x}_{1}(t)+(-4)\\cdot {x}_{2}(t)+2\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)+1\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t) \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t)=3\\cdot {x}_{1}(t)+2\\cdot {x}_{2}(t)+0\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)+4\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in matrix form:\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 \\\\ 3 & 2\\end{aligned}]x(t)+[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)+[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) \\\\ {x}_{2}(t)\\end{aligned}].$"] ["question-48e63c6e-e110-5f2f-9c73-cb4374b7c6c6" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-be99c1cf-9606-5cac-85ca-8bcf7bfdd5d0" :answer-field/id #uuid "be99c1cf-9606-5cac-85ca-8bcf7bfdd5d0"] ["answer-858cb189-c87b-5c12-8cae-08db96e24407" :answer/id #uuid "858cb189-c87b-5c12-8cae-08db96e24407"] ["answer-858cb189-c87b-5c12-8cae-08db96e24407" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-858cb189-c87b-5c12-8cae-08db96e24407" :answer/value "1"] ["answer-field-be99c1cf-9606-5cac-85ca-8bcf7bfdd5d0" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-be99c1cf-9606-5cac-85ca-8bcf7bfdd5d0" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-be99c1cf-9606-5cac-85ca-8bcf7bfdd5d0" :answer-field/correct "answer-858cb189-c87b-5c12-8cae-08db96e24407"] ["answer-field-be99c1cf-9606-5cac-85ca-8bcf7bfdd5d0" :answer-field/choices "answer-858cb189-c87b-5c12-8cae-08db96e24407"] ["answer-field-6ad21e9c-b394-53e0-abac-39126c2eaed6" :answer-field/id #uuid "6ad21e9c-b394-53e0-abac-39126c2eaed6"] ["answer-f2b5958f-36f6-5197-b67d-199edfefbc79" :answer/id #uuid "f2b5958f-36f6-5197-b67d-199edfefbc79"] ["answer-f2b5958f-36f6-5197-b67d-199edfefbc79" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f2b5958f-36f6-5197-b67d-199edfefbc79" :answer/value "-4"] ["answer-field-6ad21e9c-b394-53e0-abac-39126c2eaed6" :answer-field/key "field-2"] ["answer-field-6ad21e9c-b394-53e0-abac-39126c2eaed6" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-6ad21e9c-b394-53e0-abac-39126c2eaed6" :answer-field/correct "answer-f2b5958f-36f6-5